            <p>The killer feature? <strong>Conversational prompting.</strong> Instead of learning prompt syntax, you simply tell ChatGPT what you want: "Create a futuristic cityscape at sunset with flying cars." ChatGPT then expands your idea into a detailed prompt and generates 1-2 images in ~30 seconds.</p>

